        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0013001"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A relationship between a neuron and a region, where the neuron has a functionally relevant number of input and/or output synapses distributed throughout that region (rather than confined to a subregion).</obo:IAO_0000115>
