        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>OBSOLETE. q1 decreased_in_magnitude_relative_to q2 if and only if magnitude(q1) &lt; magnitude(q2). Here, magnitude(q) is a function that maps a quality to a unit-invariant scale.</owl:annotatedTarget>
