        <rdfs:comment>There should be  relation here to ENVO:rock and ENVO:gravel, but it&apos;s more than &quot;primarily composed of&quot; and must call upon the idea of &quot;ground surface&quot; or layer.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/envo.owl"/>
        <rdfs:label>stony desert</rdfs:label>
