            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Pools formed as a high tide comes in over a rocky shore. Water fills depressions in the ground, which turn into isolated pools as the tide retreats.</obo:IAO_0000115>
