        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A large closed depression draining underground, with a flat floor across which there may be an intermittent or perennial stream and which may be liable to flood and become a lake. The floor makes a sharp break with parts of surrounding slopes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
