            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Organic matter in soil which has reached a point of stability, where it will break down no further and might, if conditions do not change, remain essentially as it is for centuries, or millennia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
