        <obo:IAO_0000115>The marine abyssal zone biome comprises regions of the marine benthic biome  between approximately 2500 m and 6000 m depth. This zone generally coincides with the continental rise and the abyssal plain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>ORCID:0000-0002-4366-3088</oboInOwl:created_by>
