        <obo:IAO_0000115>A marine chemocline is a marine cline caused by a strong, vertical chemistry gradient within a body of marine water. Chemoclines most commonly occur where local conditions favor the formations of anoxic bottom water.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>ORCID:0000-0002-4366-3088</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2010-03-16T12:16:11Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
