        <rdfs:comment>This class corresponds to  the &quot;Tropical Deciduous / semi-deciduous broadleaf forest&quot; category of the updated Global Forest Map classification (GFM 2000). To reconstruct the original class, an aggregate class with this and the &quot;tropical deciduous broadleaf forest&quot; class can be made.</rdfs:comment>
