                            </owl:Restriction>
                        </owl:intersectionOf>
                    </owl:Class>
                </owl:someValuesFrom>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A succession of swirling vortices caused by the unsteady separation of flow of a fluid around one or more blunt bodies.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Kármán vortex street</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>von Kármán vortex street</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>These vortices are responsible for such phenomena as the &quot;singing&quot; of suspended telephone or power lines, and the vibration of a car antenna at certain speeds.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/envo.owl"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Karman vortex street</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
