        <obo:IAO_0000115>An environment which has its properties and composition determined by a portion of Bondon cheese.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>This class was cross-axiomatised with FOODON, but recent changes in FOODON&apos;s alignment (e.g. Bondon cheese as a subclass of an information artifact) have caused reasoning errors. We await FOODON to stabilise these semantics before attempting a reimport and will work with them to this end.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/envo#envoMeo"/>
