        <obo:IAO_0000115>A vegetated area which has not been cleared or is sparsely settled, usually scrub-covered or forested</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>the bush</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>&quot;Bush&quot; is a rather loosely defined regional term, primarily used in Australia.</rdfs:comment>
