            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An oasis is a vegetated area located in a desert, supplied with water from a water source which it surrounds, and surrounded by arid soil, sand, or rock.</obo:IAO_0000115>
