        <obo:IAO_0000115>An oceanic mussel reef which is primarily settled by mussels of the genus Bathymodiolus and primarily composed of self-adhered or conglomerated mussel shells</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>Bathymodiolus-dominated oceanic mussel reef substrate</obo:IAO_0000118>
