        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001852"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A process during which the ability of a material entity to maintain its internal organisation fails, resulting in deformation and a breakdown of that organisation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
