        <rdfs:comment>The exact delimitations of what is a &quot;small&quot; lake are somwhat vague. For details on &quot;Small lakes&quot; (e.g. Cameroon crater lakes)  see http://worldwildlife.org/biomes/small-lake-ecosystems.</rdfs:comment>
