            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Ocean water which is part of a sea and which has its properties and composition more strongly influenced by terrestrial processes - such as river runoff, groundwater seepage, aeolian transport of dust - than waters of the open ocean.</obo:IAO_0000115>
