        <obo:IAO_0000115>A bodily fluid material which is composed primarily of chyle, a bodily fluid consisting of a milky fluid consisting of lymph and emulsified fats; formed in the small intestine during digestion of ingested fats.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chyle</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
