        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A modular structure created by bees (Anthophila) from beeswax, consisting of a mass of hexagonal prismatic cells used to store honey, pollen, and house brood (eggs, larvae, and pupae).</obo:IAO_0000115>
