        <obo:IAO_0000115>An ice formation process during which water is frozen into a form of new ice such as frazil, grease ice, slush, or shuga.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Make this class the union of the following processes: frazil ice formation, grease ice formation process, slush formation process, and shuga formation process.</obo:IAO_0000116>
