        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">hoop greenhouse</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">hoophouse</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">polyhouse</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">These tunnels are usually semi-circular, square or elongated in shape. These are not subclasses of ENVO:tunnel as they are not built underground or underwater.</rdfs:comment>
