        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">term requester also included &lt;denser than water&gt; and &lt;usually suspended in water&gt;, but they may only be found in wikipedia&apos;s definition</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:created_by rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6670-9157"/>
