        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Industrial parks are usually located on the edges of, or outside, the main residential area of a city and that can be thought of as a more &quot;heavyweight&quot; version of a business park or office park, which has offices and light industry, rather than heavy industry.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/envo.owl"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">industrial park</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
