        <obo:IAO_0000112 xml:lang="en">The section labelled &apos;genome announcement&apos; in a typical scientific journal article, e.g. in Kim et al. J Bacteriol. 2011 Oct; 193(19): 5537. (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3187466/)</obo:IAO_0000112>
