        <obo:IAO_0000112 xml:lang="en">From Xiao et al. BMC Anesthesiol. 2013; 13: 33. (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4016475/):

The pre-publication history for this paper can be accessed here:
http://www.biomedcentral.com/1471-2253/13/33/prepub</obo:IAO_0000112>
