        <obo:IAO_0000112 xml:lang="en">The section labelled &apos;related work&apos; in a typical scientific journal article, e.g. Žitnik and Zupan. Bioinformatics. 2015 Jun 15; 31(12): i230–i239. (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4542780/)</obo:IAO_0000112>
