        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A disomy quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s containing two copies of the chromosome from one of the parents (with no contribution from the other parent).</owl:annotatedTarget>
