        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An aneuploidy quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s containing three, instead of two, chromosomes of a particular numbered type in an organism.</owl:annotatedTarget>
