        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A trisomy quality inhering in a bearer when part of the bearer&apos;s extra chromosome is attached to one of the other chromosomes, or if one of the bearer&apos;s chromosomes has two copies of part of its chromosome.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Partial_trisomy</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
