        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000018"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A fluorescence quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s exhibiting fluorescence which is self-induced.</obo:IAO_0000115>
