        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000460"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s being abnormal and having a destructive effect on living tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
