            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A convex 3-D shape quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s resemblance to a cube (a 3-D shape with a square cross section).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>cuboidal</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
