        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A shape quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s consisting of two curves, in opposite directions. S-shaped.</owl:annotatedTarget>
