        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>plant_anatomy</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>PO:0025430</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>The phyllome anlagen is only detectable by gene expression, not morphology.</rdfs:comment>
