            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Anterior part of the embryonic digestive tract that develops into a mouth. The stomodeum includes as parts an invagination of the ectoderm and the stomodeal cavity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
