            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The epithelial component of the choroid plexus. Consists of cuboidal epithelial cells surrounding a core of capillaries and loose connective tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
