        <obo:IAO_0000115>Epithelium that derives from the endoderm. Examples: urothelium, transitional epithelium of ureter, epithelium of prostatic gland.[FMA].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>endoderm-derived epithelium</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
