            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The sum total of mesenchymal tissue in the pharyngeal arch region. Pharyngeal mesenchyme is undifferentiated, loose connective tissue derived mostly from mesoderm, and also contains ectodermally derived neural crest cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
