        <obo:IAO_0000115>Front (ventral) portion of the vascular, pigmentary, or middle coat of the eye, including the ciliary body and the iris.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Haller tunica vascula</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
